  "title": "Hydrogen Fuel Cells in Retail Material Handling",
  "summary": "The retail industry saw the value of hydrogen fuel cells early and quickly adopted them in their distribution centers to meet their sustainability goals. But the benefits didn’t stop and just greening their operations. With lead-acid batteries powering their distribution center forklifts, companies had to give up valuable floor space for storage, charging, and mid-shift […]",
